78
00:05:34,100 --> 00:05:39,560
The Wizard King is at Clover Castle fighting someone who appears to be the leader of the Eye of the Midnight Sun.

79
00:05:40,940 --> 00:05:43,700
As was the case with the previous assault on the capital.

80
00:05:44,340 --> 00:05:46,560
It's possible that they're plotting multiple attacks.

81
00:05:47,300 --> 00:05:50,680
Knights, please follow your Captain's orders on where to stand guard.

82
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:54,860
And Captains, finish organizing your guard squads and assemble in the Royal Capital.

83
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:57,700
