92
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:21,960
It's always best to stay calm.

93
00:06:21,960 --> 00:06:27,820
Even though my sister isn't here, we will follow the instructions from the capital and attack the enemy on our own.

94
00:06:28,940 --> 00:06:30,140
He's got a point.

95
00:06:30,400 --> 00:06:32,140
This is no time for us to falter.

96
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:34,660
Yeah, we're the Crimson Lion Kings!

97
00:06:35,620 --> 00:06:39,160
It says we're to follow orders, but the Captain is nowhere to be found.

98
00:06:39,880 --> 00:06:42,180
I sure hope Captain Vongens gets back soon.

99
00:06:42,180 --> 00:06:46,800
Don't tell me.

100
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:54,060
I hope I'm wrong about this.

101
00:06:54,060 --> 00:07:08,760
Your attacks are growing quite pedestrian.

102
00:07:09,340 --> 00:07:13,380
Even without looking into the future, I don't think I'll have very much trouble avoiding them.

103
00:07:13,380 --> 00:07:43,360
I don't think I'll have very much trouble in the future, but I don't think I'll have very much trouble in the future.

104
