258
00:15:57,100 --> 00:15:59,460
What kind of crazy spell is that?

259
00:15:59,460 --> 00:16:01,780
It's almost like you're turning back time or something.

260
00:16:01,780 --> 00:16:03,040
It looks that way,

261
00:16:03,140 --> 00:16:04,780
but that's not exactly the case.

262
00:16:05,180 --> 00:16:06,380
Time magic, huh?

263
00:16:06,880 --> 00:16:08,060
That is impressive.

264
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:10,780
Seems like it would be a surefire way

265
00:16:10,780 --> 00:16:11,800
to prevent casualties.

266
00:16:12,380 --> 00:16:13,600
You're Zara, aren't you?

267
00:16:14,120 --> 00:16:15,780
